// Class vocabulary: every vocation a creature may learn, declared as an
// ordered entry list. Load assigns each id a runtime handle in entry
// order; handles are unstable across loads (entry order decides them),
// so saved data must translate through the id mapping, never store raw
// handles. Entry form (a record) leaves room for kernel fields (stat
// modifiers, skills, …) to grow in place.
[ ( class: "warrior" ) ]
